carassets.toyota-europe.com/e3c7749f-1b9f-4f8d-9dac-ac24badec4a8.PNG" srcSet="https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/PNG/resize/180X180/e3c7749f-1b9f-4f8d-9dac-ac24badec4a8.webp 180w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/PNG/resize/225X225/e3c7749f-1b9f-4f8d-9dac-ac24badec4a8.webp 225w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/PNG/resize/336X336/e3c7749f-1b9f-4f8d-9dac-ac24badec4a8.webp 336w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/PNG/resize/386X386/e3c7749f-1b9f-4f8d-9dac-ac24badec4a8.webp 386w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/PNG/resize/426X426/e3c7749f-1b9f-4f8d-9dac-ac24badec4a8.webp 426w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/PNG/resize/772X772/e3c7749f-1b9f-4f8d-9dac-ac24badec4a8.webp 772w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/PNG/resize/852X852/e3c7749f-1b9f-4f8d-9dac-ac24badec4a8.webp 852w" alt="" role="presentation" loading="lazy" draggable="false"/></figure><div class="TruncatedText__container--HTs4n" id="text-content-:R1ipqd:"><input type="checkbox" class="TruncatedText__checkbox--VgXyK" id="read-more-toggle-:R1ipqd:" disabled=""/><div class="TruncatedText__text--jvlzh"><div><p>Elegante og moderne felger. Disse nye 19" tofargede alufelgene med høy kontrast er formet til et slitesterkt fem-eikers design og har skinnende hjulkapsler som blir lagt merke til.</p></div></div></div></article><article class="HighlightsSlider__slide--HQmmc"><h3 class="Text__header-regular--ITTjn Text__heading-global--rDWeu">360 Panorama ryggekamera: Dra nytte av et bredt perspektiv</h3><figure><img src="https://t1-carassets.toyota-europe.com/ed586227-0afb-4173-a708-038df2ded571.PNG" srcSet="https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/PNG/resize/180X180/ed586227-0afb-4173-a708-038df2ded571.webp 180w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/PNG/resize/225X225/ed586227-0afb-4173-a708-038df2ded571.webp 225w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/PNG/resize/336X336/ed586227-0afb-4173-a708-038df2ded571.webp 336w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/PNG/resize/386X386/ed586227-0afb-4173-a708-038df2ded571.webp 386w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/PNG/resize/426X426/ed586227-0afb-4173-a708-038df2ded571.webp 426w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/PNG/resize/772X772/ed586227-0afb-4173-a708-038df2ded571.webp 772w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/PNG/resize/852X852/ed586227-0afb-4173-a708-038df2ded571.webp 852w" alt="" role="presentation" loading="lazy" draggable="false"/></figure><div class="TruncatedText__container--HTs4n" id="text-content-:R1kpqd:"><input type="checkbox" class="TruncatedText__checkbox--VgXyK" id="read-more-toggle-:R1kpqd:" disabled=""/><div class="TruncatedText__text--jvlzh"><div><p>Få fordeleneav forbedret kjøresikt.360 Panorama ryggekamera bruker fire kameraer foran, bak, på venstre og høyre side av kjøretøyet for å gi et 360-graders fugleperspektivbilde av blindsonene dine.</p></div></div></div></article><article class="HighlightsSlider__slide--HQmmc"><h3 class="Text__header-regular--ITTjn Text__heading-global--rDWeu">Adaptivt frontlyssystem (AHS): Lys opp veien foran deg</h3><figure><img src="https://t1-carassets.toyota-europe.com/fe7a249c-ef8e-4d88-ac6c-9f0718eaf554.PNG" srcSet="https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/PNG/resize/180X180/fe7a249c-ef8e-4d88-ac6c-9f0718eaf554.webp 180w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/PNG/resize/225X225/fe7a249c-ef8e-4d88-ac6c-9f0718eaf554.webp 225w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/PNG/resize/336X336/fe7a249c-ef8e-4d88-ac6c-9f0718eaf554.webp 336w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/PNG/resize/386X386/fe7a249c-ef8e-4d88-ac6c-9f0718eaf554.webp 386w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/PNG/resize/426X426/fe7a249c-ef8e-4d88-ac6c-9f0718eaf554.webp 426w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/PNG/resize/772X772/fe7a249c-ef8e-4d88-ac6c-9f0718eaf554.webp 772w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/PNG/resize/852X852/fe7a249c-ef8e-4d88-ac6c-9f0718eaf554.webp 852w" alt="" role="presentation" loading="lazy" draggable="false"/></figure><div class="TruncatedText__container--HTs4n" id="text-content-:R1mpqd:"><input type="checkbox" class="TruncatedText__checkbox--VgXyK" id="read-more-toggle-:R1mpqd:" disabled=""/><div class="TruncatedText__text--jvlzh"><div><p>Fra kjøring på landeveien til navigering i byen, lys opp veien med det smarte adaptive fjernlyssystemet. Kamerasensorer vurderer lysstyrken i omgivelsene dine og justerer automatisk lysstyrken og lysområdet til frontlyktene.</p></div></div></div></article><article class="HighlightsSlider__slide--HQmmc"><h3 class="Text__header-regular--ITTjn Text__heading-global--rDWeu">Trådløs mobillader: Lading av telefonen på farten</h3><figure><img src="https://t1-carassets.toyota-europe.com/1d57285f-24ff-42b2-89d0-b61cbb5e1fe1.PNG" srcSet="https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/PNG/resize/180X180/1d57285f-24ff-42b2-89d0-b61cbb5e1fe1.webp 180w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/PNG/resize/225X225/1d57285f-24ff-42b2-89d0-b61cbb5e1fe1.webp 225w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/PNG/resize/336X336/1d57285f-24ff-42b2-89d0-b61cbb5e1fe1.webp 336w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/PNG/resize/386X386/1d57285f-24ff-42b2-89d0-b61cbb5e1fe1.webp 386w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/PNG/resize/426X426/1d57285f-24ff-42b2-89d0-b61cbb5e1fe1.webp 426w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/PNG/resize/772X772/1d57285f-24ff-42b2-89d0-b61cbb5e1fe1.webp 772w,https://img-optimize.toyota-europe.com/cardb/PNG/resize/852X852/1d57285f-24ff-42b2-89d0-b61cbb5e1fe1.webp 852w" alt="" role="presentation" loading="lazy" draggable="false"/></figure><div class="TruncatedText__container--HTs4n" id="text-content-:R1opqd:"><input type="checkbox" class="TruncatedText__checkbox--VgXyK" id="read-more-toggle-:R1opqd:" disabled=""/><div class="TruncatedText__text--jvlzh"><div><p>Lad telefonen på farten. Hold deg tilkoblet med den Qi-kompatible trådløse laderen for å holde telefonen ladet og klar, uansett hvor du er.</p></div></div></div></article></div><div class="HighlightsSlider__slider-footer--SYzpP"><span class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">1 / 4</span><div class="HighlightsSlider__slider-buttons--O2XqD"><button type="button" class="Button__btn-arrow--W2kvL Button__btn-default--Zm4fj Button__circle--SrVMP HighlightsSlider__nav-button--aRHBb"><svg class="Icon__icon--gk3vW Icon__md--_2kiP Icon__icon--gk3vW Icon__icon-chevron-left--kdGPZ" aria-hidden="true"><use xlink:href="#chevron-left"></use></svg><span class="Accessibility__sr-only--Jea6c"><span>Forrige slide</span></span></button><button type="button" class="Button__btn-arrow--W2kvL Button__btn-default--Zm4fj Button__circle--SrVMP HighlightsSlider__nav-button--aRHBb"><svg class="Icon__icon--gk3vW Icon__md--_2kiP Icon__icon--gk3vW Icon__icon-chevron-right--xGAKo" aria-hidden="true"><use xlink:href="#chevron-right"></use></svg><span class="Accessibility__sr-only--Jea6c"><span>Neste slide</span></span></button></div></div></div></div><div class="SpecsAndHighlights__specs--xaNzY"><section id="carConfigSpecsSpaceAndRoom" aria-label="Plass" class="SpecsAndHighlights__specSection--L4JrO"><p class="Text__support-header-semibold--ok4zj Text__heading-global--rDWeu ColorTypes__grey-7--Vl83B"><span>Bilspesifikasjoner</span></p><h3 class="Text__header-regular--ITTjn Text__heading-global--rDWeu">Plass</h3><div class="SpecsDetail__wrapper--khN7a"><p class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu SpacingTypes__spacing-1--k_0RP">Stoffer av høy kvalitet og myk detaljer gir behagelige menneskelige preg til interiøret ditt, og forvandler kupeen til en innbydende plass der alle føler seg komfortable.</p><div class="SpecsDetail__grid--g7MDA"><div><div class="SpecsDetail__section--TmY19"><div><div class="SpecsDetail__subheader--VS97X"><h3 class="Text__header-body-regular--gyw4G Text__heading-global--rDWeu">Dimensjoner</h3></div><dl role="list"><div class="SpecsDetail__specs-list-item--EFyHQ"><dt><span class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">Lengde</span><div></div></dt><dd><p class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">4285 mm</p></dd></div><div class="SpecsDetail__specs-list-item--EFyHQ"><dt><span class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">Bredde</span><div></div></dt><dd><p class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">1800 mm</p></dd></div><div class="SpecsDetail__specs-list-item--EFyHQ"><dt><span class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">Høyde</span><div></div></dt><dd><p class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">1635 mm</p></dd></div><div class="SpecsDetail__specs-list-item--EFyHQ"><dt><span class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">Akselavstand</span><div></div></dt><dd><p class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">2700 mm</p></dd></div></dl></div><div><div class="SpecsDetail__subheader--VS97X"><h3 class="Text__header-body-regular--gyw4G Text__heading-global--rDWeu">Dimensjoner </h3></div><dl role="list"><div class="SpecsDetail__specs-list-item--EFyHQ"><dt><span class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">Seter</span><div></div></dt><dd><p class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">5 Seter</p></dd></div></dl></div><div><div class="SpecsDetail__subheader--VS97X"><h3 class="Text__header-body-regular--gyw4G Text__heading-global--rDWeu">Lastekapasitet</h3></div><dl role="list"><div class="SpecsDetail__specs-list-item--EFyHQ"><dt><span class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">Bagasjeromsvolum med tredje stolrad nedfelt, volum opp til tak</span><div></div></dt><dd><p class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">306 liter</p></dd></div><div class="SpecsDetail__specs-list-item--EFyHQ"><dt><span class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">Bagasjeromsvolum med alle bakseter nedfelt, volum opp til tak</span><div></div></dt><dd><p class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">562 liter</p></dd></div></dl></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="carConfigSpecsEngine" aria-label="Elektrisk motor" class="SpecsAndHighlights__specSection--L4JrO"><h3 class="Text__header-regular--ITTjn Text__heading-global--rDWeu">Elektrisk motor</h3><div class="SpecsDetail__wrapper--khN7a"><p class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu SpacingTypes__spacing-1--k_0RP">Electric Engine description</p><div class="SpecsDetail__grid--g7MDA"><div><div class="SpecsDetail__section--TmY19"><div><div class="SpecsDetail__subheader--VS97X"><h3 class="Text__header-body-regular--gyw4G Text__heading-global--rDWeu">Miljødata</h3></div><dl role="list"><div class="SpecsDetail__specs-list-item--EFyHQ"><dt><span class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">Forbruk kombinert WLTP (l/100km fra)</span><div></div></dt><dd><p class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">0 l/100 km</p></dd></div><div class="SpecsDetail__specs-list-item--EFyHQ"><dt><span class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">CO2 kombinert WLTP (g/km fra)</span><div></div></dt><dd><p class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">0 g/km</p></dd></div><div class="SpecsDetail__specs-list-item--EFyHQ"><dt><span class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">Støynivå ved passering (dB(A))</span><div></div></dt><dd><p class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">64 dB(A)</p></dd></div><div class="SpecsDetail__specs-list-item--EFyHQ"><dt><span class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">Rekkevidde kombinert WLTP (km)</span><div></div></dt><dd><p class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">395 km</p></dd></div><div class="SpecsDetail__specs-list-item--EFyHQ"><dt><span class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">Elektrisk forbruk (Wh/km)</span><div></div></dt><dd><p class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">166 Wh/km</p></dd></div></dl></div><div><div class="SpecsDetail__subheader--VS97X"><h3 class="Text__header-body-regular--gyw4G Text__heading-global--rDWeu">Ytelser</h3></div><dl role="list"><div class="SpecsDetail__specs-list-item--EFyHQ"><dt><span class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">Maksimum hastighet</span><div></div></dt><dd><p class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">150 km/t</p></dd></div><div class="SpecsDetail__specs-list-item--EFyHQ"><dt><span class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">Akselerasjon fra 0 til 100 km/t</span><div></div></dt><dd><p class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">7,4 Sekunder</p></dd></div></dl></div><div><div class="SpecsDetail__subheader--VS97X"><h3 class="Text__header-body-regular--gyw4G Text__heading-global--rDWeu">Motor</h3></div><dl role="list"><div class="SpecsDetail__specs-list-item--EFyHQ"><dt><span class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">Battery Charging Time (hours)</span><div></div></dt><dd><p class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">6 h</p></dd></div><div class="SpecsDetail__specs-list-item--EFyHQ"><dt><span class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">Maks effekt (forbrenningsmotor alene)</span><div></div></dt><dd><p class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">135 kW/omdr.</p></dd></div><div class="SpecsDetail__specs-list-item--EFyHQ"><dt><span class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">Maks dreiemoment (forbrenningsmotor alene)</span><div></div></dt><dd><p class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">307/- Nm</p></dd></div><div class="SpecsDetail__specs-list-item--EFyHQ"><dt><span class="Text__apheleia-body--olXGO Text__heading-global--rDWeu">Maks effekt totalt (el+bensin)</span><div></d